@startuml
title 数据契约变更控制

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #475569
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

rectangle "变更提案\nSchema + 语义 + SLA + 生效时间" as proposal #E0F2FE
rectangle "机器检查\nAvro 兼容、SQL/字段引用、样本校验" as check #FEF3C7
rectangle "消费者影响清单\nowner、版本、最后活跃时间" as impact
rectangle "双读 / 影子验证\n旧新结果对账" as shadow #FEE2E2
rectangle "分阶段发布\nproducer -> consumer -> 默认版本" as rollout #DCFCE7
rectangle "观测与回滚\n解析错误、null、分布、延迟" as observe #DCFCE7
rectangle "完成或撤回\n保留证据与迁移期限" as finish #E0F2FE

proposal --> check
check --> impact
impact --> shadow
shadow --> rollout
rollout --> observe
observe --> finish

note right of check
  Schema 兼容只是底线；
  “状态码含义改变”通常无法自动发现
end note

note right of finish
  契约允许变化，
  但变化不能静默发生
end note
@enduml
